US\">Even though I try to I don\u2019t fulfill my tasks like I should do\u2026<o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q55","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"Even though I try to I don\u2019t fulfill my tasks like I should do\u2026","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"never"},"2":{"Display":"rarely"},"3":{"Display":"sometimes"},"4":{"Display":"often"},"5":{"Display":"very often"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID234"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID235","SecondaryAttribute":"I experience times in which taking the responsibility for others is a burden to me\u2026","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">I experience times in which taking the responsibility for others is a burden to me\u2026<o:p><\/o:p><\/span><\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q57","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"I experience times in which taking the responsibility for others is a burden to me\u2026","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"never"},"2":{"Display":"rarely"},"3":{"Display":"sometimes"},"4":{"Display":"often"},"5":{"Display":"very often"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3","4","5"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"ON","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":6,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID235"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID236","SecondaryAttribute":"In this part of the study we are interested in your \u201cFood Preferences\u201d \u00a0 Most modern theories o","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<style type=\"text\/css\">.Skin #Buttons {\nvisibility:hidden;\n}\n<\/style>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">In this part of the study we are interested in your<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#1\" onclick=\"\">\u201cFood Preferences\u201d<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Most modern theories of consumption recognize the fact that decisions do not take place in a vacuum. Individual preferences and knowledge, along with situational variables can greatly impact the decision process. In order to facilitate our research on food consumption we are interested in knowing certain factors about you, the consumer. Specifically we are interested in whether you actually take time to read the directions; if not, then some of our manipulations that rely on changes in the instructions will be ineffective. So, in order to demonstrate that you have read the instructions, please ignore the the link above and most of the different foods listed below. Instead, simply click \"Evian\" from the option below. Thank you very much.<\/p>","QuestionJS":"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.addOnload(function()\n{\n\/*Place Your Javascript Below This Line*\/\nthis.questionclick = function(event,element){ \n\/\/ \nif (element.type == 'checkbox') \n{ \nthis.clickNextButton();\n} \n}\n});","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"MAHR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText","LabelPosition":"BELOW"},"QuestionDescription":"In this part of the study we are interested in your \u201cFood Preferences\u201d \u00a0 Most modern theories of...","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"MM's"},"2":{"Display":"Jelly Beans"},"3":{"Display":"Hershey's Kisses"},"4":{"Display":"Coca Cola"},"5":{"Display":"Evian"},"6":{"Display":"Pepsi"}},"ChoiceOrder":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<style type=\"text\/css\">.Skin #Buttons {\nvisibility:hidden;\n}\n<\/style>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">In this part of the study we are interested in your<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"#1\" onclick=\"Qualtrics.SurveyEngine.navClick(event, 'NextButton')\">\u201cFood Preferences\u201d<\/a><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Most modern theories of consumption recognize the fact that decisions do not take place in a vacuum. Individual preferences and knowledge, along with situational variables can greatly impact the decision process. In order to facilitate our research on food consumption we are interested in knowing certain factors about you, the consumer. Specifically we are interested in whether you actually take time to read the directions; if not, then some of our manipulations that rely on changes in the instructions will be ineffective. So, in order to demonstrate that you have read the instructions, please ignore the the link above and most of the different foods listed below. Instead, simply click \"Evian\" from the option below. Thank you very much.<\/p>","DataExportTag":"Q236","QuestionID":"QID236","NextChoiceId":7,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID237","SecondaryAttribute":"Click to write the question text","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"Click to write the question text","DataExportTag":"Q237","QuestionType":"MC","Selector":"SAVR","SubSelector":"TX","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Click to write the question text","Choices":{"1":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 1"},"2":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 2"},"3":{"Display":"Click to write Choice 3"}},"ChoiceOrder":["1","2","3"],"Validation":{"Settings":{"ForceResponse":"OFF","ForceResponseType":"ON","Type":"None"}},"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID237"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID238","SecondaryAttribute":"Timing","TertiaryAttribute"