DataExportTag":"Q346","QuestionID":"QID346"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID347","SecondaryAttribute":"In this task, you will be asked to choose between two monetary rewards offered at two different t...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In this task, you will be asked to <u><strong>choose between two monetary rewards offered at two different time points.<\/strong><\/u><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<u><strong>Note that one of your choices may be selected to determine the bonus payoff to you.<\/strong><\/u> All money will be transferred to you at the appropriate time depending on your choices. So please choose the option that you would prefer more.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false},"Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In this task, you will be asked to choose between two monetary rewards offered at two different t...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"In this study, you are going to...","DataExportTag":"Q347","QuestionID":"QID347"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID348","SecondaryAttribute":"In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision inv...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision involves choosing from 5 gamble options. Each option has different amounts of money you could earn if a coin flip shows heads and the amount of money you could earn if a coin flip shows tails. In other words, the winning probability is 50%.&nbsp;<\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;<\/span><br>\n<span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You should examine all 5 options carefully and should choose the one that you like most.<\/span><br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 16px;\">Note that one of the trials may be selected to determine the bonus payoff to you. You will receive the bonus earning corresponding to your decision in that trial. For example, if you chose a gamble option that promises 5\u20ac on heads and 10\u20ac on tails and if the coin flip shows heads, you earn 5\u20ac.&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q348","QuestionID":"QID348","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision inv...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID349","SecondaryAttribute":"In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision inv...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision involves choosing from 5 gamble options. Each option has different amounts of money you could earn if a coin flip shows heads and the amount of money you could earn if a coin flip shows tails. In other words, the winning probability is 50%.&nbsp;<br \/>\n&nbsp;<br \/>\n<strong>You should examine all 5 options carefully and should choose the one that you like most.<\/strong><br \/>\n<br \/>\nNote that one of the trials may be selected to determine the bonus payoff to you. You will receive the bonus earning corresponding to your decision in that trial. For example, if you chose a gamble option that promises 5&euro; on heads and 10&euro; on tails and if the coin flip shows heads, you earn 5&euro;.&nbsp;<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q349","QuestionID":"QID349","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"In the following task, you are going to make a series of independent decisions. Each decision inv...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":4,"NextAnswerId":1}},{"SurveyID":"SV_cJ7cUY3T03V4ELk","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID35","SecondaryAttribute":"Below is a list of experiences people sometimes have during and after a stressful event. Please r...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Below is a list of experiences people sometimes have during and after a stressful event. Please read each item carefully and decide <strong>how well it describes your experience toward the outbreak of COVID-19<\/strong>.<\/span>\n<div>&nbsp;<\/div>\n\n<div><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Use the 0-5 point scale shown below and choose the number that best describes your experience.<\/span><\/div>","DefaultChoices":false,"QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Below is a list of experiences people sometimes have during and after a stressful event. Please r...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"Below is a list of experiences people sometimes have during and after a stressful event. Please read each item carefully and decide how well it describes your experience toward the outbreak of COVID-19.<div><br><\/div><div>Use the 0-5 point scale shown below and choose the number that best describes your experience.<\/div>","DataExportTag":"instructions","QuestionID":"QID35","DataVisibility":{"Private":false,"Hidden":false}}}